     header mark, i.e. the watube_mark_bg tile (accent at 13%, 9.7/27.7 corner ratio) and the
     play outline of watube_logo.xml filling 18.2/27.7 of it, as in the header. The 104dp tile
     fits the circle with its corners (diagonal 147dp). -->
